sp-menu-link-accordion" id="kanko-link" style="display: none"><li><a href="/bunka_kanko/bunka/index.html" class="link">文化</a></li><li><a href="/bunka_kanko/annnai/index.html" class="link">観光</a></li><li><a href="/bunka_kanko/katusika_hokusai/index.html" class="link">葛飾北斎（北斎ふるさと納税）</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="/sangyo_jigyosya/index.html">産業・事業者向け</a><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="accordion-trigger sp-only" aria-controls="sangyo-link" id="sangyo-acoordion" aria-label="産業・事業者向けメニュー開閉"><span class="accordion-title"><span class="accordion-icon" role="img" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button><ul class="sp-menu-link-accordion" id="sangyo-link" style="display: none"><li><a href="/sangyo_jigyosya/sangyo/index.html" class="link">すみだ産業情報ナビ</a></li><li><a href="/sangyo_jigyosya/keiyaku_nyuusatu/index.html" class="link">契約・入札</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="/matizukuri/index.html">まちづくり</a><button type="button" aria-expanded="false" class="accordion-trigger sp-only" aria-controls="matizukuri-link" id="matizukuri-acoordion" aria-label="まちづくりメニュー開閉"><span class="accordion-title"><span class="accordion-icon" role="img" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></button><ul class="sp-menu-link-accordion" id="matizukuri-link" style="display: none"><li><a href="/matizukuri/tosi_keikaku/index.html" class="link">都市計画・土地利用</a></li><li><a href="/matizukuri/matizukuri_suisin/index.html" class="link">まちづくりの推進</a></li><li><a href="/matizukuri/kentiku/index.html" class="link">建築</a></li><li><a href="/matizukuri/koutu/index.html" class="link">交通</a></li><li><a href="/matizukuri/douro/index.html" class="link">道路</a></li><li><a href="/sisetu_info/kouen/index.html" class="link">公園</a></li><li><a href="/matizukuri/kasen_kyouryou/index.html" class="link">河川・橋梁</a></li><li><a href="/matizukuri/master_plan/index.html" class="link">都市計画マスタープラン</a></li><li><a href="https://www.sonicweb-asp.jp/sumida/" class="link">すみだまちづくりマップ</a></li></ul></li><li><a href="/kuseijoho/index.html">区政</